WEBVTT

00:43:29.125 --> 00:43:34.143
I offer help a lot and I have
no fear when I ask for help.

00:43:34.167 --> 00:43:35.851
I think if you can, you can,

00:43:35.875 --> 00:43:38.268
if you can't, I completely understand it.

00:43:38.292 --> 00:43:41.684
And my husband Jack will often say,

00:43:41.708 --> 00:43:45.809
"It's like, it's amazing sometimes
what I dare to ask,"

00:43:45.833 --> 00:43:49.684
but I figured that the people
will say to me when it's not --

00:43:49.708 --> 00:43:50.976
AG: How dare you?

00:43:51.000 --> 00:43:53.184
EP: No, nobody says it
like that, but it's --

00:43:53.208 --> 00:43:56.226
AG: No, that's because we're
all more agreeable than you. Yeah.

00:43:56.250 --> 00:43:59.934
EP: Or people are so shocked that somebody
would dare to ask such a thing.

00:43:59.958 --> 00:44:01.226
AG: They're speechless.